## Python Approach
Inner loops is for printing the left and right parts of the numbers. 
The outer loop handles spacing between the numbers.


## Solution
```
class Solution:
    def pattern12(self, n):
        for i in range(1,n+1):
            for j in range(1,i+1):
                print(j,end="")
            print(2*(n-i)*" ", end="")
            for j in range(i,0,-1):
                print(j,end="")
            print()
```

