## Solution
```java[]
class Solution {
    public void pattern12(int n) {
        for(int column=1; column<=n ; column++){
                addNumberAsString(column);
                addSpacesInBetween((n-column)*2);
                addNumberAsReversedString(column);
            System.out.println();
        }
    }

    public void addNumberAsString(int column){
        for(int i=1 ; i<=column ; i++) System.out.print(i);
    }

    public void addNumberAsReversedString(int column){
        for(int i=column ; i>=1 ; i--) System.out.print(i);
    }

    public void addSpacesInBetween(int spaces){
        for(int i=0; i<spaces; i++) System.out.print(" ");
    }
}
```

## Complexity
Time Complexity: O(n^2)


Space Complexity: O(1)
